{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43398","headline":"春二首 二 · 无名氏","name":"春二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌足迟迟日宫里，天门击鼓龙蛇起。\n风师剪翠换枯条，青帝挼蓝染江水。\n蜂蝶缤纷抱香蘂，锦鳞跳掷红云尾。\n绣衣白马不归来，双成倚槛春心醉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}